# HEM-6232T-D (HEM-6232T-D/E): synthetic pair probe, 2 user(s), 100 slots per user.
# Assumption: the exact model configuration selects legacy WLP4COM with these bounded record areas.
# REA: OHQBleDevice.m (2026.09.03); model-specific facts and limits: docs/bluetooth-coverage.md.
# OpenPressure uses only the verified read map; memory writes remain blocked.
name hem-6232t-d/pair
flow pair
advertise name=BLEsmart_000002440011223344 services=ecbe3980-c9a2-11e1-b1bd-0002a5d5c51b
dis model=HEM-6232T-D firmware=0001 software=0001 systemid=0011223344556677
time 2026-01-02T03:04:05 zone=UTC
key 05050505050505050505050505050505
expect omron matches
register user=2

alias unlock b305b680-aee7-11e1-a730-0002a5d5c51b
alias tx db5b55e0-aee7-11e1-965e-0002a5d5c51b,e0b8a060-aee7-11e1-92f4-0002a5d5c51b,0ae12b00-aee8-11e1-a192-0002a5d5c51b,10e1ba60-aee8-11e1-89e5-0002a5d5c51b
alias rx 49123040-aee8-11e1-a74d-0002a5d5c51b,4d0bf320-aee8-11e1-a0d9-0002a5d5c51b,5128ce60-aee8-11e1-b84b-0002a5d5c51b,560f1420-aee8-11e1-8184-0002a5d5c51b

memory fill=ff
memory 0x260 00010001000100010001000000010000
memory 0x28c 00000000000000000000000000000000
memory 0x2e8 4e6919431d2603a6000000010000
memory 0x860 505f1946202707800000000100dd

write unlock 02 00000000000000000000000000000000
notify unlock 8200
write unlock 00 05050505050505050505050505050505
notify unlock 8000
[ours-only: OpenPressure authenticates the durably saved candidate after registration] write unlock 01 05050505050505050505050505050505
[ours-only: synthetic acknowledgment for that unlock] notify unlock 8100

write tx 08 00 00 00 00 10 00 18
notify rx 18 80 00 00 00 10 00 01 02 03 04 05 06 07 08 09 0a 0b 0c 0d 0e 0f 00 88
[omron-only: official index and setting-block reads; OpenPressure reads its complete bounded index image] reads 0x260 44 chunk=44
[omron-only: official index and setting-block reads; OpenPressure reads its complete bounded index image] reads 0x28c 16 chunk=16
[ours-only: read the complete model-bound 68-byte settings/index image before populated slots] reads 0x260 68 chunk=56
[ours-only: Pair imports populated history without memory writes] reads 0x2e8 14 chunk=14
[ours-only: Pair imports populated history without memory writes] reads 0x860 14 chunk=14

# Official post-transfer memory writes observed with this synthetic peer only.
# These writes are Omron-only; OpenPressure never sends them during a transfer.
# Echo acknowledgments are invented and establish no physical device behavior.
[omron-only: official 2026.09.03 settings write at 0x2a4; docs/bluetooth-coverage.md] write tx 1801c002a4100001000100018000000100000001000000ee
[omron-only: synthetic full-echo acknowledgment, unconfirmed on hardware] notify rx 1881c002a41000010001000180000001000000010000006e
[omron-only: official 2026.09.03 settings write at 0x2c2; docs/bluetooth-coverage.md] write tx 2601c002c21e0100ff01fffffffffffffffffff90000000000000000011a03020604002a00f2
[omron-only: synthetic full-echo acknowledgment, unconfirmed on hardware] notify rx 2681c002c21e0100ff01fffffffffffffffffff90000000000000000011a03020604002a0072

write tx 08 0f 00 00 00 00 00 07
notify rx 08 8f 00 00 00 00 00 87

[ours-only: OpenPressure imports history during Pair; Omron returns settings only] expect reading user=1 sys=130 dia=78 pulse=67 time=2025-07-09T06:14:38
[ours-only: OpenPressure imports both selected users during Pair] expect reading user=2 sys=120 dia=80 pulse=70 time=2025-08-01T07:30:00
